WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:12.040
385 million years ago, fish had fingers.

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:18.160
Half of all human beings have mites living
in their eyelashes.

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:23.949
The average Internet user goes online 34 times
a day.

00:00:23.949 --> 00:00:30.489
The cast of Riverdance have worn out 14,000
pairs of shoes.

00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:33.230
Cruise ships have morgues on board.

00:00:33.230 --> 00:00:39.500
Roughly 200 people die on cruises each year,
most deaths are due to old age.

00:00:39.500 --> 00:00:44.120
So most ships have small morgues that can
store up to 10 bodies.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:49.840
The design for the Guy Fawkes mask, commonly
worn by anonymous protestors fighting against

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:54.550
government and corporate corruption, is owned
by Time Warner.

00:00:54.550 --> 00:00:59.900
Ironically Time Warner gets a percentage of
the profits every time one of the masks is

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:01.180
sold.

00:01:01.180 --> 00:01:06.499
In response to a question from a 5 year old,
the Royal Mail has calculated that it would

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:14.819
cost £11,602.25 to send a letter to Mars.

00:01:14.819 --> 00:01:24.909
The floods in Australia in 2010 and 2011 caused
the world's sea levels to drop by seven millimetres.

00:01:24.909 --> 00:01:30.969
For 87 years, the Portuguese kept the existence
of Ascension Island completely secret from

00:01:30.969 --> 00:01:33.579
the rest of the world.

00:01:33.579 --> 00:01:40.249
If the Earth had no clouds, the sea would
completely evaporate.

00:01:40.249 --> 00:01:47.060
In 19th-century Britain, prisoners were let
out for the day if they paid a fee of £5.

00:01:47.060 --> 00:01:50.829
Roughly £300 in today's money.

00:01:50.829 --> 00:01:56.799
Human beings had been keeping sheep for 7,000
years before it occurred to anyone to use

00:01:56.799 --> 00:01:58.420
their wool.

00:01:58.420 --> 00:02:05.380
If everyone washed their hands properly with
soap, it would save 600,000 lives a year.

00:02:05.380 --> 00:02:12.890
During its lifetime, the International Space
Station will be hit by 100,000 meteoroids.

00:02:12.890 --> 00:02:21.210
In World War II, many German soldiers used
steroids to make themselves more aggressive.

00:02:21.210 --> 00:02:28.240
The first motor insurance policy issued by
Lloyd's of London described the car as a 'ship

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:33.440
navigating on land'.

